+
+| Command | Exit | Current Evidence |
+|---|---|---|
+| `pnpm install --offline --frozen-lockfile` | 0 | `task-projects-release-source-install.log` |
+| `pnpm test --maxWorkers=2` | 0 | `task-projects-release-source-units.log`; 287 tests, 46 files |
+| `pnpm lint` | 0 | `task-projects-release-source-lint.log`; ESLint and semantic check |
